silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#vetrecord_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#vetrecord_77" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#vetrecord_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord_77 is the electronic health record VetRecord_77 for Mittens-the-cat (microchip ID 44B2F9) created at the Tartu Animal Clinic on 2026-05-18. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'EncyclopediaEntry', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#vetcareplan_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#vetcareplan_77" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#vetcareplan_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetCarePlan_77 is the clinical care plan VetCarePlan_77 rendered as a PDF after Mittens's VetRecord_77 passed all four publication gates. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'PublicationClaim', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#tartuclinicintakeform a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#tartuclinicintakeform" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#tartuclinicintakeform silm:hasLongDescription "The TartuClinicIntakeForm is the DICOM/HL7 intake form submitted by the Tartu Animal Clinic for Mittens's May 2026 annual exam. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SourceBoundary', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittensspeciesnode a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#mittensspeciesnode" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittensspeciesnode silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensSpeciesNode is the typed species node: DomesticCat, Felis catus, TSN 183798, assigned to Mittens during the type gate of VetRecord_77's publication pipeline. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TypedNode', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#shaclpassreport_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#shaclpassreport_77" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#shaclpassreport_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The SHACLPassReport_77 is the SHACL validation pass report for VetRecord_77: all required fields present, species-taxonomy cross-check passed, measurement units conform to SI. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ValidatedClaim', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#vetcareplanpdf_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#vetcareplanpdf_77" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#vetcareplanpdf_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetCarePlanPDF_77 is the rendered PDF of VetCarePlan_77: the formatted four-page care plan for Mittens delivered to the owner on 2026-05-18. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'PublishedEntry', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittenscolimitapex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#mittenscolimitapex" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittenscolimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimitApex is the colimit apex colim D_Mittens: Mittens-the-cat assembled from the twelve typed legs (record, identifier, quality, measurement, value, unit, role, process, validation, trace, classification, taxonomy)." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittenssourcediagram a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#mittenssourcediagram" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittenssourcediagram silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensSourceDiagram is the source diagram D_Mittens indexed by the twelve typed leg tags, each pointing to a concrete observation facet of Mittens-the-cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#clinicalsummaryrecord a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#clinicalsummaryrecord" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#clinicalsummaryrecord silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicalSummaryRecord is the clinical summary record 77 from the Tartu Animal Clinic, the concrete competing cocone for the universal property test: any other compatible cocone factors uniquely through VetCarePlan_77. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetCarePlan_77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittensidentifierleg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#mittensidentifierleg" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittensidentifierleg silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensIdentifierLeg is Mittens's ISO 11784 microchip ID 44B2F9: the identifier leg into D_Mittens, distinct from Mittens herself. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'MicrochipID_44', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#clinicpublishoperation a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#clinicpublishoperation" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#clinicpublishoperation silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicPublishOperation is the Tartu Animal Clinic's four-gate publication operation: intake form -> species typing -> SHACL validation -> PDF rendering. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'publish', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#encyclopediaindexcategory a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#encyclopediaindexcategory" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#encyclopediaindexcategory silm:hasLongDescription "The EncyclopediaIndexCategory is the index category whose objects are the 42 encyclopedia entry slugs and whose arrows are the spine-inheritance arrows declared in Chapter 12. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'J_whitepaper', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
